stages.sampleAnswer:
GET /docs/:docId
  → 200 { docId, title, content, currentVersion, activeEditors: [{userId, name, cursor}] }

POST /docs/:docId/edits
  body: { op: { type, position, content }, clientId }
  → 200 { version, transformedOp }

WS /docs/:docId/sync
  subscribe → stream of { version, op: { userId, type, position, content }, timestamp }

POST /docs/:docId/presence
  body: { cursor, selection, name }
  → 200
